    "dosageAdministration": "A thin layer of Topibac should be applied to the affected area (up to 100 cm 2 in total area in adults or 2% total body surface area in pediatric patients aged 9 months or older) twice daily for 5 days. The treated area may be covered with a sterile bandage or gauze dressing if desired.",
