    "dosageAdministration": "Traveler's Diarrhea : For patients ≥12 years of age: 200 mg 3 times daily for 3 days. Hepatic Encephalopathy: For patients ≥18 years of age: 550 mg 2 times daily. Bacterial overgrowth of irritable bowel syndrome : 400 mg 3 times daily for 10 days or 550 mg 3 times daily for 14 days. Can be taken with or without food",
