    "dosageAdministration": "Adult or Elderly : The recommended initial dose 10 mg. The dose may be increased to 20 mg after 1-2 weeks depending on the clinical effect. Children 2-5 years : The recommended normal dose 10 mg (10 ml syrup). Children 6-12 years : The recommended normal dose 10 mg (10 ml syrup). The dose may be increased to 20 mg.",
